    text: "Change\r\nExtend route to Orchard Pkwy and 144th Ave.\r\n\nReason\r\nChange was requested by stakeholders and policy makers and will provide paratransit service to The Grove Community.\r\n\nSurvey Results\r\nOut of 29 respondents, 89% reported a positive impact from the change, 7% indicated it had no impact, and 3% perceived the change negatively."
    language: "en"
